OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 01 SEP
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1939FThe BBC Television Service
OL,7,Fcloses down due to the outbreak of
OL,8,FWorld War II. The final programme
OL,9,Ftransmitted was a Mickey Mouse cartoon,
OL,10,FMickey's Gala Premier.
OL,11,
OL,12,CG1961FBorder Television - the ITV
OL,13,Ffranchisee for the England-Scotland
OL,14,Fborder and Isle of Man - begins
OL,15,Fbroadcasting.
OL,16,
OL,17,CG1962FChannel Television - the ITV
OL,18,Ffranchisee for the Channel Islands -
OL,19,Fbegins broadcasting.
OL,20,
OL,21,
OL,22,
