OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 01 SEP
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1984FThe Children's Channel begins
OL,7,Fbroadcasting almost exclusively to
OL,8,Fcable households (as opposed to via
OL,9,Fsatellite) in the UK and Europe.
OL,10,
OL,11,CG1989FITV launches its first attempt
OL,12,Fat a proper corporate identity. The
OL,13,F1989 ITV logo was the first concerted
OL,14,Feffort to turn ITV into a brand
OL,15,Falthough there had been previous
OL,16,Fattempts at generic logos - notably the
OL,17,F"rainbow" ITV blocks seen on some
OL,18,Ftrailers from the mid-1980s, which also
OL,19,Finspired the ITV Schools graphics on
OL,20,FChannel 4.
OL,21,
OL,22,
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
