OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1993FBritish Sky Broadcasting
OL,7,Flaunches Sky Multichannels - a package
OL,8,Fof analogue television channels
OL,9,Favailable from 1st September 1993 to
OL,10,F27th September 2001. The package
OL,11,Fstarted off with 14 channels and
OL,12,Feventually expanded to over 40.
OL,13,
OL,14,CG1996FThe Computer Channel begins
OL,15,Fbroadcasting in the UK. It was
OL,16,Frebranded .tv in 1998.
