OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1996FSky Two begins broadcasting. The
OL,7,Fchannel closed a year later, before
OL,8,Freappearing in 2005 following the
OL,9,Frebrand of Sky Mix. In August 2020, Sky
OL,10,FTwo was rebranded as Sky Replay.
OL,11,
OL,12,CG1997FThe National Geographic channel
OL,13,Fbegins broadcasting in the UK.
OL,14,
OL,15,CG1999FNick Jnr begins broadcasting in
OL,16,Fthe UK.
