OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG2021FSky Showcase begins
OL,7,Fbroadcasting. The channel replaces Sky
OL,8,FOne. The new channel shows a selection
OL,9,Fof programmes from Sky's diverse
OL,10,Fportfolio of channels.
OL,11,
OL,12,CG2021FSky Max begins broadcasting. The
OL,13,Fchannel is home to entertainment and
OL,14,Fdrama productions.
OL,15,
OL,16,CG2021FSky One ceased broadcasting just
OL,17,Fbefore 6am. It's replaced by Sky
OL,18,FShowcase.
OL,19,
OL,20,CG2023FThe CITV channel ceases
OL,21,Fbroadcasting.
OL,22,
